ncil) are:\n- Internal Storage (29/42)\n- Alarms? Wait screenshot drawer shows \"Alarms\" as first bookmark. The element [44] contains \"Android\" | \"Alarms\" - hmm that's weird. Let me map by positions: drawer entries are at y coordinates: Internal Storage 617, Alarms 788? Wait screenshot: Internal Storage at y~470 (in screenshot scale). Hmm, screenshot is 1080x2400? Actually the screenshot preview appears ~900x2000. The element coordinates are in 1080x2400 space: Internal Storage element at (399,617), then [44] at (399,788) contains \"Android\" | \"Alarms\", [46] at (399,914) \"Alpha\", [48] at (399,1040) \"Nov 14 | 6:33 AM\" | \"Audiobooks\", [50] at (399,1166) \"Audiobooks\" | \"Beta\", [52] at (399,1292) \"DCIM\", ...\n\nSo the drawer entries are: 617 Internal Storage, 788 Alarms, 914 Alpha, 1040 Audiobooks, 1166 Beta, 1292 DCIM, 1418 Download, 1544 Movies, 1670 Music, 1796 Pictures, 1967 Quick access...\n\nWait but screenshot showed order Alarms, Alpha, Audiobooks, Beta, DCIM... and y positions match: Alarms 788, Alpha 914, Audiobooks 1040, Beta 1166.\n\nWait, but screenshot shows drawer \"Alarms\" at y~655 (of 2000) which scales to 786. Yes.\n\nOK. So element_ref 48 = Audiobooks entry at (399,1040). I'll quote \"Audiobooks\" maybe combined. Let me choose element_ref=48 and observed_quote=\"Alpha\\nAudiobooks\\nBeta\"? The exact text of element 44 is \"Android\" | \"Alarms\" etc. Quotes must be verbatim from observation. I can quote \"Audiobooks\" verbatim. It shows Audiobooks displayed before Beta even though added after. Good enough maybe. But safer: quote \"Audiobooks\" and explain.\n\nHmm, but risk of rejection if quote never on screen - it is on screen. OK.\n\nActually, maybe I should reconsider whether this is truly a bug. The task's \"Changed in this build\" says bookmarks ordered by when added. Our test shows alphabetical. That's a clear mismatch → likely the intended bug to find. I'm fairly confident.\n\nWait, also consider: maybe addition order is o