 (all reset to list on restart). So that test is stale.\n\nLet me redo the same-name test properly:\n1. Navigate to /Amaze/Alpha, set GRID.\n2. Navigate to /Amaze/Beta/Alpha, check if it's grid or list. If grid → the setting is shared by name (bug!). If list → per path.\n3. Also change /Amaze/Beta/Alpha to list (if not), then go back and check /Amaze/Alpha remains grid.\n\nThis is a plausible planted bug (\"per folder path\" — maybe the implementation uses the folder NAME as the key, so same-named folders share the mode). Let's test!\n\nCurrent location: root (drawer open, 28 folders). Navigate to Amaze/Alpha. Close drawer, tap AndroidQA, Amaze, Alpha.\n\nActually, the drawer has no Amaze bookmark now. Let me close and navigate manually."}
